(mu < nu)\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "4"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "3"}], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["H", "2"], " ", 
       RowBox[{"Cot", "[", 
        RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"G_04 == R_04 (because g_04 = 0)\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"Kretschmann scalar R_abcd R^abcd\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["3", "2"], " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["a", "4"], "+", 
       RowBox[{"6", " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["H", "2"]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"8", " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["H", "4"]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["H", "4"], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1245", "+", 
          RowBox[{"108", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
            RowBox[{"12", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}]}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
           RowBox[{"24", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"Cot", "[", 
          RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], "4"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"Csc", "[", 
          RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], "4"]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"8", " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["H", "4"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
          RowBox[{"12", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], "2"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"Csc", "[", 
          RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], "8"]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"R, G^mu_mu, R_04 and R_abcd R^abcd do not depend on x4\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"x0^4 R as x0 -> 0\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     FractionBox["7", 
      RowBox[{"108", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["H", "2"]}]]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"x0^8 R_abcd R^abcd as x0 -> 0\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    FractionBox["85", 
     RowBox[{"69984", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["H", "4"]}]]}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[8]=",ExpressionUUID->"3d2ef023-116f-4234-80c4-220fa8450d98"],

Cell["\<\
gPure = DiagonalMatrix[{1, 1, 1, 1, -1, -gjj[[1]], -gjj[[2]], -gjj[[3]]}];
RicP = ricciG[gPure, X]; RsP = Simplify[Tr[Inverse[gPure].RicP], assumD];
<|\"pure deflation: Ricci scalar\" -> RsP, \"pure deflation: Kretschmann \
scalar\" -> kretschmannDiag[gPure, X],
 \"pure deflation: mixed Einstein tensor\" -> \
Simplify[Diagonal[Inverse[gPure].(RicP - (1/2) RsP gPure)], assumD]|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[9]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6a069ba8-7dda-48d1-9534-803611087349"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"pure deflation: Ricci scalar\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"3", " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"pure deflation: Kretschmann scalar\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"3", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["a", "4"]}], "2"]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"pure deflation: mixed Einstein tensor\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "2"]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "2"]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "2"]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "2"]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "4"]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "4"]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "4"]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"3", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["a", "2"]}], "4"]}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[9]=",ExpressionUUID->"a052b6b8-a7e8-4a4e-a9d5-65e7f2300156"],

Cell["\<\
Geometry of the deflating block. In the pure deflation field every Riemann \
component with an index in x0..x3 vanishes (x0..x3 span flat R^4), and the \
block (x4, x5, x6, x7) with metric -dx4^2 - g55 dx5^2 - g66 dx6^2 - g77 dx7^2 \
is maximally symmetric: R_abcd = (a^2/4)(g_ac g_bd - g_ad g_bc). With w = \
(2/a) E^(a x4/2) and yj = Sqrt[bjj] xj (j = 5, 6, 7) its metric becomes \
-(4/a^2)(dw^2 + dy5^2 + dy6^2 + dy7^2)/w^2. The metric of the block is \
negative definite and minus it is the Poincare upper-half-space metric \
(4/a^2)(dw^2 + dy5^2 + dy6^2 + dy7^2)/w^2 of the hyperbolic 4-space H^4 of \
radius 2/a: the time x4 and the three deflating degrees of freedom form an \
H^4 whose four directions are all timelike. The infinite past x4 -> -Infinity \
is the boundary w = 0, the infinite future x4 -> +Infinity is w -> Infinity. \
This is why R = 12/(2/a)^2 = 3 a^2 and R_abcd R^abcd = 24/(2/a)^4 = 3 a^4/2 \
are constant.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f207071e-2178-41ab-8080-871e53cce32e"],

Cell["\<\
Y4 = {x4, x5, x6, x7}; g4 = DiagonalMatrix[{-1, -gjj[[1]], -gjj[[2]], \
-gjj[[3]]}];
RP = riemannG[gPure, X]; R4 = riemannG[g4, Y4];
R4low = Table[Sum[g4[[i, p]] R4[[p, j, k, l]], {p, 4}], {i, 4}, {j, 4}, {k, \
4}, {l, 4}];   (* R_abcd = g_ap R^p_bcd *)
xOfY = {(2/a) Log[a w/2], y5/Sqrt[b55], y6/Sqrt[b66], y7/Sqrt[b77]}; JacY = \
D[xOfY, {{w, y5, y6, y7}}];
gW = Simplify[Transpose[JacY].(g4 /. x4 -> xOfY[[1]]).JacY, assumD && w > 0];
<|\"Riemann components with an index in x0..x3 all vanish\" -> \
AllTrue[Flatten[Table[If[Min[i, j, k, l] <= 4, RP[[i, j, k, l]], 0], {i, 8}, \
{j, 8}, {k, 8}, {l, 8}]], # === 0 &],
 \"(x4..x7) block: R_abcd == (a^2/4)(g_ac g_bd - g_ad g_bc)\" -> \
(Simplify[R4low - Table[(a^2/4) (g4[[i, k]] g4[[j, l]] - g4[[i, l]] g4[[j, \
k]]), {i, 4}, {j, 4}, {k, 4}, {l, 4}], assumD] === ConstantArray[0, {4, 4, 4, \
4}]),
 \"metric of the block in (w, y5, y6, y7)\" -> gW, \"equals -(4/a^2) I4/w^2\" \
-> (Simplify[gW + (4/a^2)/w^2 IdentityMatrix[4], assumD && w > 0] === \
ConstantArray[0, {4, 4}])|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[10]:=",ExpressionUUID->"2a6f0d93-1c7b-4f5e-8fce-aa41ad12039f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"Riemann components with an index in x0..x3 all vanish\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"(x4..x7) block: R_abcd == (a^2/4)(g_ac g_bd - g_ad g_bc)\"\>",
     "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"metric of the block in (w, y5, y6, y7)\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         FractionBox["4", 
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["w", "2"]}]]}], ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], 
       "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", 
        RowBox[{"-", 
         FractionBox["4", 
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["w", "2"]}]]}], ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", 
        RowBox[{"-", 
         FractionBox["4", 
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["w", "2"]}]]}], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", 
        RowBox[{"-", 
         FractionBox["4", 
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["a", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["w", "2"]}]]}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"equals -(4/a^2) I4/w^2\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[10]=",ExpressionUUID->"76e679c6-a203-4a1f-84f0-a8e2f14c7107"],

Cell["\<\
Part 6. Geodesics: deflation turns world lines back in the time x4\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3a6ff5cd-f1fa-402b-b8bb-cdcfb758a2e2"],

Cell["\<\
For a world line moving in (x4, x5) the momentum p5 = g_55 dx5/dlambda = -g55 \
dx5/dlambda is conserved, so dx5/dlambda = -(p5/b55) E^(a x4) grows \
exponentially. Normalising -(dx4/dlambda)^2 - g55 (dx5/dlambda)^2 = -1 gives \
(dx4/dlambda)^2 = 1 - (p5^2/b55) E^(a x4): the world line reaches a TURNING \
POINT x4* = (1/a) Log[b55/p5^2] and cannot proceed to later x4. We also check \
the x4 geodesic equation d^2x4/dlambda^2 = -Gamma^4_55 (dx5/dlambda)^2. In \
the coordinates w = (2/a) E^(a x4/2), y5 = Sqrt[b55] x5 of the hyperbolic \
block (Part 5) the world line is a semicircle (y5 - y5c)^2 + w^2 = w*^2 of \
radius w* = 2 Sqrt[b55]/(a |p5|) standing on the boundary w = 0, because \
(dw/dy5)^2 = (w*^2 - w^2)/w^2; its top w = w* is the turning point x4*. The \
world line comes from x4 -> -Infinity and returns to x4 -> -Infinity.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"94e769b2-c05a-417a-b4ed-93d4614f2402"],

Cell["\<\
x5dot = p5/(-gjj[[1]]);
x4dot2 = Simplify[1 - gjj[[1]] x5dot^2, assumD];
Gam45 = christoffelG[DiagonalMatrix[{-1, -gjj[[1]]}], {x4, x5}];
wOf = (2/a) E^(a x4/2); wstar = 2 Sqrt[b55]/(a p5);
<|\"dx5/dlambda\" -> Simplify[x5dot], \"(dx4/dlambda)^2\" -> x4dot2, \
\"turning point x4*\" -> Simplify[x4 /. First[Solve[x4dot2 == 0, x4, Reals]], \
assumD && p5 > 0],
 \"x4 geodesic equation satisfied: (1/2) d(x4dot^2)/dx4 == -Gamma^4_55 \
x5dot^2\" -> Simplify[(1/2) D[x4dot2, x4] == -Gam45[[1, 2, 2]] x5dot^2, \
assumD],
 \"semicircle in (y5, w): (dw/dy5)^2 == (w*^2 - w^2)/w^2\" -> \
(Simplify[(D[wOf, x4]^2 x4dot2)/(Sqrt[b55] x5dot)^2 - (wstar^2 - \
wOf^2)/wOf^2, assumD && p5 > 0] === 0),
 \"w at the turning point == w* = 2 Sqrt[b55]/(a p5)\" -> (Simplify[(wOf /. \
x4 -> Log[b55/p5^2]/a) - wstar, assumD && p5 > 0] === 0)|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[11]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6206f1ae-8857-40ed-9997-7a65e2361c44"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"dx5/dlambda\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}]], " ", "p5"}], "b55"]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"(dx4/dlambda)^2\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["p5", "2"]}], "b55"]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"turning point x4*\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
      FractionBox["b55", 
       SuperscriptBox["p5", "2"]], "]"}], "a"]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"x4 geodesic equation satisfied: (1/2) d(x4dot^2)/dx4 == \
-Gamma^4_55 x5dot^2\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"semicircle in (y5, w): (dw/dy5)^2 == (w*^2 - w^2)/w^2\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"w at the turning point == w* = 2 Sqrt[b55]/(a p5)\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[11]=",ExpressionUUID->"8cb9b33e-51a4-4034-b8b8-db6d52f42eea"],

Cell["\<\
Part 7. Euler-Lagrange equations of dirac16complex in the deflation field\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3959e023-f5e4-40ed-ace5-af3d43501a94"],

Cell["\<\
L = Sqrt|g| [ (1/2)(psibar gamma^mu D_mu psi - (D_mu psibar) gamma^mu psi) - \
m psibar psi - (lam/2)(psibar psi)^2 ], gamma^mu = E_A^mu T^A, D_mu psi = \
d_mu psi + Omega_mu psi, Omega_mu = (1/4) omega_mu^A_B T_A T^B with T_A = \
eta_AB T^B, omega_mu^A_B = e^A_nu (d_mu E_B^nu + Gamma^nu_{mu la} E_B^la). \
The Euler-Lagrange equations are derived with left Grassmann derivatives and \
compared with the matrix form; the mass-sign maps C psi = Gamma psi^* and P1 \
psi(x) = T^1 psi(R1 x) are checked as exact Grassmann identities.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"501cdf45-2590-4bd0-b0f5-4dbfbf6d9fad"],

Cell["\<\
scD = spinConnection[eDefl, X]; OmD = scD[\"Omega\"]; gamD = scD[\"gam\"];
LD = gScale[sqrtgD, gAdd[gScale[1/2, gAdd @@ Table[gBil[psiS, \
sigma16.gamD[[mu + 1]], dpsi[mu]], {mu, 0, 7}]], gScale[1/2, gBil[psiS, \
Simplify[sigma16.Sum[gamD[[mu]].OmD[[mu]], {mu, 8}]], psi]],
    gScale[-1/2, gAdd @@ Table[gBil[dpsiS[mu], sigma16.gamD[[mu + 1]], psi], \
{mu, 0, 7}]], gScale[1/2, gBil[psiS, \
Simplify[sigma16.Sum[OmD[[mu]].gamD[[mu]], {mu, 8}]], psi]], gScale[-m, \
Sbil], gScale[-lam/2, gMul[Sbil, Sbil]]]];
realRuleD = {Conjugate[m] -> m, Conjugate[lam] -> lam, Conjugate[H] -> H, \
Conjugate[a] -> a, Conjugate[b55] -> b55, Conjugate[b66] -> b66, \
Conjugate[b77] -> b77, Conjugate[x0] -> x0, Conjugate[x4] -> x4};
ELD = Table[gSimplify[gAdd[gDL[gen[\"psiS\", aa, {}], LD], gScale[-1, gAdd @@ \
Table[gDx[mu, gDL[gen[\"psiS\", aa, {mu}], LD], X], {mu, 0, 7}]]], assumD], \
{aa, 0, 15}];
DpsiD = Fold[gVecAdd, Table[gMatVec[gamD[[mu + 1]], gVecAdd[dpsi[mu], \
gMatVec[OmD[[mu + 1]], psi]]], {mu, 0, 7}]];
expectedD = gMatVec[sqrtgD sigma16, gVecAdd[gVecAdd[DpsiD, gVecScale[-m, \
psi]], gVecScale[-lam, Table[gMul[Sbil, psi[[b]]], {b, 16}]]]];
spinD = Simplify[Sum[gamD[[mu]].OmD[[mu]], {mu, 8}], assumD];
ruleC[gen[\"psi\", aa_, d_]] := gAdd @@ Table[gScale[Gamma5[[aa + 1, b + 1]], \
gGen[gen[\"psiS\", b, d]]], {b, 0, 15}];
ruleC[gen[\"psiS\", aa_, d_]] := gAdd @@ Table[gScale[Gamma5[[aa + 1, b + \
1]], gGen[gen[\"psi\", b, d]]], {b, 0, 15}];
ruleP[gen[t_, aa_, d_]] := gScale[(-1)^Count[d, 1], gAdd @@ \
Table[gScale[T16A[1][[aa + 1, b + 1]], gGen[gen[t, b, d]]], {b, 0, 15}]];
<|\"gamma^mu covariantly constant\" -> covConst[scD], \"L real\" -> \
gZeroQ[gSimplify[gAdd[gConj[LD, realRuleD], gScale[-1, LD]], assumD]],
 \"EL == Sqrt|g| sigma16 (gamma^mu D_mu psi - m psi - lam (psibar psi) psi)\" \
-> (And @@ MapThread[gZeroQ[gSimplify[gAdd[#1, gScale[-1, #2]], assumD]] &, \
{ELD, expectedD}]),
 \"E_A^A factors (gamma^mu = E_A^mu T^A)\" -> Simplify[1/eDefl, assumD],
 \"spin-connection term gamma^mu Omega_mu: coefficients of T^0..T^7\" -> \
Table[Simplify[Tr[spinD.T16A[A]] eta4488[[A + 1, A + 1]]/16, assumD], {A, 0, \
7}],
 \"L[Gamma psi^*] == L(m->-m)[psi]\" -> gZeroQ[gSimplify[gAdd[gLinSub[LD, \
ruleC], gScale[-1, LD /. m -> -m]], assumD]],
 \"L[T1 psi(R1 x)] == L(m->-m)[psi](R1 x)\" -> \
gZeroQ[gSimplify[gAdd[gLinSub[LD, ruleP], gScale[-1, LD /. m -> -m]], \
assumD]]|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[12]:=",ExpressionUUID->"26829225-0902-49d9-8f10-bf31976ac73c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"gamma^mu covariantly constant\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   
   RowBox[{"\<\"L real\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"EL == Sqrt|g| sigma16 (gamma^mu D_mu psi - m psi - lam \
(psibar psi) psi)\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"E_A^A factors (gamma^mu = E_A^mu T^A)\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cot", "[", 
       RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"H", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
         RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], 
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "6"}]]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"H", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
         RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], 
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "6"}]]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"H", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
         RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], 
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "6"}]]}], ",", "1", ",", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}], "2"]], 
       SqrtBox["b55"]], ",", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}], "2"]], 
       SqrtBox["b66"]], ",", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}], "2"]], 
       SqrtBox["b77"]]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"spin-connection term gamma^mu Omega_mu: coefficients of \
T^0..T^7\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        FractionBox["3", "2"]}], " ", "H", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"Cot", "[", 
         RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], "2"]}], ",", "0", ",", 
      "0", ",", "0", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        FractionBox["3", "4"]}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"a", "+", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "H"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], 
     "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"L[Gamma psi^*] == L(m->-m)[psi]\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"L[T1 psi(R1 x)] == L(m->-m)[psi](R1 x)\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    "True"}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[12]=",ExpressionUUID->"75180499-e476-49ca-9553-0cea111595c4"],

Cell["\<\
Hence the field equation of dirac16complex in the deflation field is, \
explicitly,
Cot[6Hx0] T^0 d0 psi + E^(H x4) Sin[6Hx0]^(1/6) (T^1 d1 + T^2 d2 + T^3 d3) \
psi + T^4 d4 psi + E^(a x4/2) (T^5 d5/Sqrt[b55] + T^6 d6/Sqrt[b66] + T^7 \
d7/Sqrt[b77]) psi - (3/2) H Cot[6Hx0]^2 T^0 psi - (3/2)(H + a/2) T^4 psi = (m \
+ lam psibar psi) psi .
The deflating directions enter through the GROWING factors E^(a \
x4/2)/Sqrt[bjj], and the deflation adds the friction term -(3a/4) T^4 psi.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"03a91217-57c0-4970-b0e8-c6e2ea1ab13e"],

Cell["\<\
Part 8. Universes in the deflation field: dispersion, turning point and \
critical deflation rate\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"29ea47c1-6034-4a8a-9e7e-91c677a2d175"],

Cell["\<\
Universes are mode functions: c-number solutions of the linear part of the \
field equation (lam = 0; in a mean-field (Kohn-Sham) treatment of the quartic \
term with constant rho_s = <psibar psi>, m stands for the effective mass m + \
lam rho_s). The exact rescaling psi = F chi, F = Sin[6Hx0]^(1/4) E^(3(a + 2H) \
x4/4), removes both spin-connection (friction) terms, because gamma^mu d_mu F \
+ F gamma^mu Omega_mu = 0. For a mode chi = Exp[I (k0 x0 + k1 x1 + k2 x2 + k3 \
x3 + q5 x5 + q6 x6 + q7 x7 - omega x4)] u with frozen (adiabatic) \
coefficients c_A = 1/e_A, the field equation gives (I S - I omega T^4 - m) u \
= 0 with S = Sum_(A != 4) c_A k_A T^A (k_5, k_6, k_7 = q5, q6, q7). Because S \
anticommutes with T^4 and S^2 = Sum_(A != 4) eta_AA (c_A k_A)^2 I16, \
solutions exist iff omega^2 = m^2 + S^2:
omega^2 = m^2 + Cot[6Hx0]^2 k0^2 + E^(2 H x4) Sin[6Hx0]^(1/3) \
(k1^2+k2^2+k3^2) - E^(a x4) (q5^2/b55 + q6^2/b66 + q7^2/b77).
Momentum along a deflating (timelike) direction LOWERS omega^2 with weight \
E^(a x4). For k1=k2=k3=0, omega^2 = m^2 + Cot[6Hx0]^2 k0^2 - E^(a x4) \
(q5^2/b55 + q6^2/b66 + q7^2/b77) decreases strictly with x4, so the universe \
turns from oscillating (omega^2 > 0) to exponentially growing (omega^2 < 0) \
at the unique point x4* = (1/a) Log[(m^2 + Cot[6Hx0]^2 k0^2)/(q5^2/b55 + \
q6^2/b66 + q7^2/b77)]. With 3-space momentum the late-time sign of omega^2 is \
decided by the competition E^(2 H x4) versus E^(a x4): the critical deflation \
rate is a_c = 2H. At a = 2H exactly, omega^2 = m^2 + Cot[6Hx0]^2 k0^2 + E^(2 \
H x4) (Sin[6Hx0]^(1/3) (k1^2+k2^2+k3^2) - q5^2/b55 - q6^2/b66 - q7^2/b77), \
and the late-time sign is the sign of the bracket.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7842ba68-9b1c-4500-92f6-a3197f6d0ca3"],

Cell["\<\
FD = Sin[z0]^(1/4) E^(3 (a + 2 H) x4/4);
cD = Simplify[1/eDefl, assumD]; kv = {k0, k1, k2, k3, 0, q5, q6, q7};
Sslash = Sum[cD[[A + 1]] kv[[A + 1]] T16A[A], {A, 0, 7}];
omega2 = Simplify[m^2 + Sum[eta4488[[A + 1, A + 1]] (cD[[A + 1]] kv[[A + \
1]])^2, {A, 0, 7}], assumD];
qq = q5^2/b55 + q6^2/b66 + q7^2/b77; om0 = omega2 /. {k1 -> 0, k2 -> 0, k3 -> \
0}; x4starD = Log[(m^2 + k0^2 Cot[z0]^2)/qq]/a;
om2H = Simplify[omega2 /. a -> 2 H, assumD]; C2H = \
Simplify[Coefficient[Expand[om2H], E^(2 H x4)], assumD];
sampleD = {H -> 1, x0 -> 1/10, m -> 1, k0 -> 0, k1 -> 1, k2 -> 0, k3 -> 0, q5 \
-> 1, q6 -> 0, q7 -> 0, b55 -> 1, b66 -> 1, b77 -> 1};
<|\"psi = F chi removes the spin connection: gamma^mu d_mu F + F gamma^mu \
Omega_mu == 0\" -> (Simplify[Sum[gamD[[mu]] D[FD, X[[mu]]], {mu, 8}] + FD \
spinD, assumD] == 0 ID16),
 \"S^2 == Sum eta_AA (c_A k_A)^2 I16\" -> (Simplify[Sslash.Sslash - \
Sum[eta4488[[A + 1, A + 1]] (cD[[A + 1]] kv[[A + 1]])^2, {A, 0, 7}] ID16, \
assumD] == 0 ID16),
 \"{S, T^4} = 0\" -> (Simplify[Sslash.T16A[4] + T16A[4].Sslash] == 0 ID16), \
\"omega^2\" -> omega2,
 \"k1=k2=k3=0: omega^2 == m^2 + k0^2 Cot^2 - E^(a x4) Sum qj^2/bjj\" -> \
(Simplify[om0 - (m^2 + k0^2 Cot[z0]^2 - E^(a x4) qq), assumD] === 0),
 \"d omega^2/dx4 == -a E^(a x4) Sum qj^2/bjj < 0\" -> (Simplify[D[om0, x4] + \
a E^(a x4) qq, assumD] === 0),
 \"omega^2 == 0 at x4* = Log[(m^2 + k0^2 Cot^2)/Sum qj^2/bjj]/a\" -> \
(Simplify[om0 /. x4 -> x4starD, assumD && m > 0 && qq > 0] === 0),
 \"a = 2H: coefficient C2H of E^(2 H x4) in omega^2\" -> C2H, \"a = 2H: \
omega^2 == m^2 + k0^2 Cot^2 + C2H E^(2 H x4)\" -> (Simplify[om2H - (m^2 + \
k0^2 Cot[z0]^2 + C2H E^(2 H x4)), assumD] === 0),
 \"late time, H = 1, a = 3 > 2H\" -> Limit[omega2 /. sampleD /. a -> 3, x4 -> \
Infinity], \"late time, H = 1, a = 2 = 2H\" -> Limit[omega2 /. sampleD /. a \
-> 2, x4 -> Infinity],
 \"late time, H = 1, a = 1 < 2H\" -> Limit[omega2 /. sampleD /. a -> 1, x4 -> \
Infinity]|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[13]:=",ExpressionUUID->"bf534fa5-5f5b-45e5-b8fe-1646617ba46c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"psi = F chi removes the spin connection: gamma^mu d_mu F + F \
gamma^mu Omega_mu == 0\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"S^2 == Sum eta_AA (c_A k_A)^2 I16\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"{S, T^4} = 0\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"omega^2\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["q5", "2"]}], "b55"], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["q6", "2"]}], "b66"], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
        RowBox[{"a", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["q7", "2"]}], "b77"], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["k0", "2"], " ", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"Cot", "[", 
        RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], "2"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "H", " ", "x4"}]], " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["k1", "2"], "+", 
        SuperscriptBox["k2", "2"], "+", 
        SuperscriptBox["k3", "2"]}], ")"}], " ", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
        RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "3"}]]}]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"k1=k2=k3=0: omega^2 == m^2 + k0^2 Cot^2 - E^(a x4) Sum \
qj^2/bjj\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"d omega^2/dx4 == -a E^(a x4) Sum qj^2/bjj < 0\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"omega^2 == 0 at x4* = Log[(m^2 + k0^2 Cot^2)/Sum \
qj^2/bjj]/a\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"a = 2H: coefficient C2H of E^(2 H x4) in omega^2\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["q5", "2"], "b55"]}], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      SuperscriptBox["q6", "2"], "b66"], "-", 
     FractionBox[
      SuperscriptBox["q7", "2"], "b77"], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["k1", "2"], "+", 
        SuperscriptBox["k2", "2"], "+", 
        SuperscriptBox["k3", "2"]}], ")"}], " ", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
        RowBox[{"6", " ", "H", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "3"}]]}]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"a = 2H: omega^2 == m^2 + k0^2 Cot^2 + C2H E^(2 H x4)\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"late time, H = 1, a = 3 > 2H\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"-", "\[Infinity]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"late time, H = 1, a = 2 = 2H\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"-", "\[Infinity]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"late time, H = 1, a = 1 < 2H\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    "\[Infinity]"}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[13]=",ExpressionUUID->"f716a309-ffaa-4ecd-aa57-690355cd00f6"],

Cell["\<\
Exact evolution in the pure deflation field (x0..x3 flat, e_4 = 1, e_j = \
Sqrt[bjj] E^(-a x4/2)). There gamma^mu Omega_mu = -(3a/4) T^4, and with psi = \
E^(3 a x4/4) Exp[I (k1 x1 + q5 x5)] chi(x4) the linear field equation \
gamma^mu D_mu psi = m psi becomes exactly E^(3 a x4/4) Exp[I (k1 x1 + q5 x5)] \
T^4 (chi' - M chi) = 0, i.e. chi' = M chi with M = T^4 (I k1 T^1 + I q5 c(x4) \
T^5 - m), c(x4) = E^(a x4/2)/Sqrt[b55] (checked in the next cell). We start \
at x4 = -8 in a positive-frequency universe of the K = +1 (+mass) sector, \
solve numerically (a = b55 = k = m = 1, q = 1/2, so x4* = Log[8] = 2.079) and \
record the norm chi^dagger chi and the fraction in the K = -1 (-mass) sector.\
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"35dcc294-c5d0-4484-a54a-fff6a1e7cf86"],

Cell["\<\
ePure = {1, 1, 1, 1, 1, Sqrt[b55] E^(-a x4/2), Sqrt[b66] E^(-a x4/2), \
Sqrt[b77] E^(-a x4/2)};
scP = spinConnection[ePure, X];
chiS = Array[ch[#][x4] &, 16]; phaseP = E^(3 a x4/4) E^(I (k1 x1 + q5 x5)); \
psiP = phaseP chiS;
DpsiP = Sum[scP[\"gam\"][[mu]].(D[psiP, X[[mu]]] + \
scP[\"Omega\"][[mu]].psiP), {mu, 8}] - m psiP;     (* gamma^mu D_mu psi - m \
psi *)
Mchi = T16A[4].(I k1 T16A[1] + I q5 E^(a x4/2)/Sqrt[b55] T16A[5] - m ID16);
aN = 1; bN = 1; kN = 1; mN = 1; qN = 1/2; x4star = Log[(mN^2 + \
kN^2)/(qN^2/bN)]/aN;
h0 = -kN T16A[4].T16A[1] - I mN T16A[4];             (* instantaneous \
Hamiltonian at c = 0 ; chi' = -I h chi *)
Kp = (ID16 + K)/2; Km = (ID16 - K)/2;
{vals0, vecs0} = Eigensystem[N[Kp.h0.Kp + 10 Km]];
start = Normalize[vecs0[[First[Ordering[Abs[vals0 - Sqrt[kN^2 + mN^2]], 1]]]]];
chiF = Array[cf, 16];
eqs = Thread[D[#[x4] & /@ chiF, x4] == T16A[4].(I kN T16A[1] + I qN Exp[aN \
x4/2]/Sqrt[bN] T16A[5] - mN ID16).(#[x4] & /@ chiF)];
solChi = First[NDSolve[Join[eqs, Thread[(#[-8] & /@ chiF) == start]], chiF, \
{x4, -8, 5}, MaxSteps -> 10^6, PrecisionGoal -> 10, AccuracyGoal -> 10]];
chiAt[x_] := (#[x] & /@ chiF) /. solChi;
normAt[x_] := Re[Conjugate[chiAt[x]].chiAt[x]]; minusFrac[x_] := \
Re[Conjugate[chiAt[x]].Km.chiAt[x]]/normAt[x];
plusW[x_] := Re[Conjugate[chiAt[x]].Kp.chiAt[x]]; minusW[x_] := \
Re[Conjugate[chiAt[x]].Km.chiAt[x]];   (* P+ , P- *)
<|\"pure deflation field: gamma^mu covariantly constant\" -> covConst[scP], \
\"pure deflation field: gamma^mu Omega_mu == -(3a/4) T^4\" -> \
(Simplify[Sum[scP[\"gam\"][[mu]].scP[\"Omega\"][[mu]], {mu, 8}] + (3 a/4) \
T16A[4], assumD] == 0 ID16),
 \"gamma^mu D_mu psi - m psi == E^(3a x4/4) E^(I(k1 x1 + q5 x5)) T^4.(chi' - \
M chi)\" -> (Simplify[DpsiP - phaseP T16A[4].(D[chiS, x4] - Mchi.chiS), \
assumD] === ConstantArray[0, 16]),
 \"x4*\" -> N[x4star], \"start is a +omega eigenvector in K=+1\" -> \
{Chop[N[Conjugate[start].h0.start]], Chop[N[Conjugate[start].Km.start]]},
 \"norm at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 4, 5\" -> N[normAt /@ {-8, 0, x4star, 3, 4, \
5}], \"K=-1 fraction at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 5\" -> N[minusFrac /@ {-8, 0, \
x4star, 3, 5}],
 \"P+ (weight of the +mass sector K=+1) at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 5\" -> N[plusW \
/@ {-8, 0, x4star, 3, 5}], \"P- (weight of the -mass sector K=-1) at x4 = -8, \
0, x4*, 3, 5\" -> N[minusW /@ {-8, 0, x4star, 3, 5}],
 \"Krein charge Q = P+ - P- = chi^dagger K chi at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 5\" -> \
N[(plusW[#] - minusW[#]) & /@ {-8, 0, x4star, 3, 5}],
 \"max over x4 = -8, -7, ..., 5 of |K=-1 fraction - (norm - 1)/(2 norm)|\" -> \
Max[Table[Abs[minusFrac[x] - (normAt[x] - 1)/(2 normAt[x])], {x, -8, 5}]]|>\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[14]:=",ExpressionUUID->"01335234-e490-4562-a057-ea6619a58f2a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"pure deflation field: gamma^mu covariantly constant\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"pure deflation field: gamma^mu Omega_mu == -(3a/4) T^4\"\>", "\[Rule]",
     "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"gamma^mu D_mu psi - m psi == E^(3a x4/4) E^(I(k1 x1 + q5 x5)) \
T^4.(chi' - M chi)\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"x4*\"\>", "\[Rule]", "2.0794415416798357`"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"start is a +omega eigenvector in K=+1\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"1.4142135623730951`", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"norm at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 4, 5\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "1.`", ",", "1.067409453695482`", ",", "1.9672504379730684`", ",", 
      "10.010160722635687`", ",", "1198.1900459703008`", ",", 
      "1.0587953046760937`*^7"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"K=-1 fraction at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 5\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "1.232595164407831`*^-31", ",", "0.03157622876752146`", ",", 
      "0.24583816482812526`", ",", "0.45005076290732215`", ",", 
      "0.499999952776518`"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"P+ (weight of the +mass sector K=+1) at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 5\
\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "1.`", ",", "1.033704688596978`", ",", "1.4836252005444437`", ",", 
      "5.505080252588585`", ",", "5.293977023380475`*^6"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"P- (weight of the -mass sector K=-1) at x4 = -8, 0, x4*, 3, 5\
\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "1.232595164407831`*^-31", ",", "0.03370476509850364`", ",", 
      "0.4836252374286248`", ",", "4.505080470047102`", ",", 
      "5.293976023380458`*^6"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"Krein charge Q = P+ - P- = chi^dagger K chi at x4 = -8, 0, \
x4*, 3, 5\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "1.`", ",", "0.9999999234984744`", ",", "0.999999963115819`", ",", 
      "0.999999782541483`", ",", "1.0000000167638063`"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"max over x4 = -8, -7, ..., 5 of |K=-1 fraction - (norm - \
1)/(2 norm)|\"\>", "\[Rule]", "7.17543257486861`*^-7"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[14]=",ExpressionUUID->"09fcef20-40ac-451b-990d-978ea7ea8407"],

Cell["\<\
GraphicsRow[{LogPlot[normAt[x], {x, -8, 5}, PlotRange -> All, AxesLabel -> \
{\"x4\", \"chi^dagger chi\"}, PlotLabel -> \"norm (dashed: turning point x4* \
= Log 8)\", GridLines -> {{x4star}, None}, GridLinesStyle -> Dashed],
  Plot[minusFrac[x], {x, -8, 5}, PlotRange -> All, AxesLabel -> {\"x4\", \
\"K=-1 fraction\"}, PlotLabel -> \"fraction of the -mass sector\"],
  LogPlot[{plusW[x], minusW[x]}, {x, -8, 5}, PlotRange -> All, AxesLabel -> {\
\"x4\", \"weight\"}, PlotLegends -> Placed[{\"P+ (+mass)\", \"P- (-mass)\"}, \
{Left, Top}], PlotLabel -> \"P+ - P- = 1: created in pairs\"]}, ImageSize -> \
1250]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[15]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e855d521-d48a-445f-8047-b552cf38e011"],

